DESCRIPTION:Paulie Calafiore came up on the soccer field and on reality TV 
 long before comedy. First gaining notice on Big Brother Season 18 and later
  becoming one of The Challenge’s most talked-about competitors\, he turne
 d real-life drama into must-watch TV. Before reality fame\, the New Jersey 
 native captained his high school and Rutgers University soccer teams\, then
  went on to train as a bobsledder for Team USA and chase every athletic edg
 e he could find. Along the way he’s been admired\, debated\, and yes\, ac
 cused of being a charmer - but lately he’s been rewriting his own script\
 , openly embracing his bisexual identity and bringing that honesty (and ple
 nty of laughs) to every room he walks into. Now Paulie takes the mic to ble
 nd his world of reality TV\, competitive highs\, awkward lows\, Jersey swag
 ger\, and sharp observations into a set that’s personal\, unpredictable\,
  and impossible to ignore.\n\nAges 18+\nFee applies if transferring confirm
 ed ticket purchase to another guest.\nDoors for open for seating approximat
 ely 30 minutes before late showtimes. Please note\, doors are subject to pr
